330	    /**
331	     * Emits an immutable structured {@code OWNER_CREATED} event to the {@code AUDIT} logger, alongside the
332	     * human-readable audit line. The event is a JSON object
333	     * {@code {seq, ownerId, memberId, membershipLevel, event}} where {@code seq} is a process-wide,
334	     * monotonically increasing sequence number across all creates.
335	     *
336	     * <p>The {@code memberId} field carries the owner's <em>current primary identifier</em> — see
337	     * {@link #primaryIdentifier(Owner)} — which is now the unified member id.
338	     *
