838	     * date is a Saturday, a Sunday or a listed public holiday it is rolled forward one day at a time until
839	     * it reaches the next non-holiday business day; a weekday that is not a holiday is returned unchanged.
840	     * This applies equally to a date supplied in the request and to a date defaulted to the server date, and
841	     * the adjusted value is what becomes the owner's {@code registrationDate}, so every value derived from it
